Package: opencode
Name: OpenCode
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: max
Author: max
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://opencode.ai
Depends: bun, ripgrep
Description: OpenCode CLI for rootless iOS.
 OpenCode @OPENCODE_VERSION@ bundled from pinned source commit @OPENCODE_COMMIT@
 and executed with the repo's iPhoneOS Bun runtime. The package also ships
 iOS-native OpenTUI and fff dylibs for TUI rendering and fuzzy search, plus
 a rootless wrapper at /var/jb/usr/bin/opencode.
